#: tmainform.lbldirstate.caption
msgid "Direction: left-to-right (bdLeftToRight)"
msgstr "方向:从左往右 (bdLeftToRight)"

#: tmainform.lbllegend.caption
msgid "Mirroring is PARTIAL and that is the point. Each area below states what moves and what does not - anything unlabelled has not been built yet, it is not broken."
msgstr "镜像是**部分**完成的,这正是本例要说明的事。下面每一区都写明了什么会动、什么不动 —— 没标注的是还没做,不是坏了。"

#: tmainform.lbltry.caption
msgid "Try to break it: click the exact pixel a glyph was drawn on (check box, sort triangle, filter funnel, tree chevron, tab close x); drag the status bar's bottom-LEFT corner; open a menu and then its submenu; drag a grid column edge; right-click this strip for a popup with a submenu."
msgstr "试着把它弄坏:对着某个图元实际画出来的那一个像素点下去(复选框、排序三角、筛选漏斗、树形折叠箭头、页签关闭 x);拖状态栏**左下角**;打开菜单再打开它的子菜单;拖网格的列边;在这条上右键弹出带子菜单的快捷菜单。"

