#: tmainform.lblcontainernote.caption
msgid "DOES NOT MIRROR, on purpose: containers never mirror their children's Align/Anchors layout, so these three columns keep their order. LCL's own align engine has no BiDi branch, and diverging from it would misplace every ported .lfm."
msgstr "**故意不镜像**:容器从不镜像子控件的 Align/Anchors 布局,所以这三栏保持原顺序。LCL 自己的对齐引擎就没有 BiDi 分支,跟它分叉会让每一个移植过来的 .lfm 全错位。"

