#: tmainform.lblformnote.caption
msgid "These controls answer clicks over their whole face, so paint and hit test cannot come apart - which is why they shipped first. The group boxes are the exception worth pressing: they hold real child check boxes and radio buttons, each flipping its own indicator, so click the exact pixel an indicator was drawn on after switching direction. The colour swatch and the badge corner are the other two small targets; a taCenter button caption is expected NOT to move. The glyph buttons take their star from the system symbol font, whose family name differs per platform - an empty slot is a missing font, not a mirroring fault, and the SLOT still changes sides."
msgstr "这些控件的整个面都响应点击，所以绘制与命中不可能对不上 —— 这也是它们最先落地的原因。值得按的例外是两个分组框：它们装着真正的子复选框/单选钮，各自翻自己的指示器，所以换向之后请对着指示器画出来的那一个像素点下去。颜色色块和角标那个角是另外两个小目标；taCenter 的按钮文字**本来就不该动**。图标按钮的星号取自系统符号字体，而那个字族名各平台不同 —— 槽位空着是字体缺失，不是镜像出错，而且**槽位本身照样换边**。"

#: tmainform.pgdata.caption
msgid "2  Data views"
msgstr "2  数据视图"

#: tmainform.divgrid.caption
msgid "TTyStringGrid - MIRRORS, and every hit test follows the paint"
msgstr "TTyStringGrid —— **会镜像**,而且每一处命中都跟着绘制走"

#: tmainform.lblgridnote.caption
msgid "MIRRORS: column order, the row-number gutter, the two frozen columns, header captions, the sort triangle, the filter funnel, the tree chevron and its indent, the check-box cell and the button cell. DELIBERATELY DOES NOT: the vertical scroll bar stays on the right, and the filter drop-down does not mirror its own rows - both are pinned by tests, not accidents. Note a resize grip is a column's LEFT edge under RTL, and dragging it left widens the column."
msgstr "**会镜像**:列顺序、行号槽、两个冻结列、表头文字、排序三角、筛选漏斗、树形折叠箭头与缩进、复选框单元格与按钮单元格。**故意不镜像**:竖向滚动条留在右边,筛选下拉不镜像它自己的行 —— 两处都有测试钉着,不是遗漏。另注意:RTL 下改列宽的手柄是列的**左**边,往左拖是把列**加宽**。"

#: tmainform.divlv.caption
msgid "TTyListView - DOES NOT MIRROR yet"
msgstr "TTyListView —— **还不镜像**"

#: tmainform.divtv.caption
msgid "TTyTreeView - DOES NOT MIRROR yet"
msgstr "TTyTreeView —— **还不镜像**"

#: tmainform.lbldatanote.caption
msgid "Side by side on purpose - the contrast is the documentation. Flip the switch: the grid turns round whole, these two do not move at all. That is a stated gap. Their column model writes a per-column left field that nine separate expressions independently turn into a screen x, so mirroring the paint alone would leave every click behind."
msgstr "故意并排放 —— 对比本身就是文档。拨开关:网格整个翻过来,这两个纹丝不动。这是写在案上的缺口。它们的列模型写的是每列一个 left 字段,有九处互不相干的表达式各自把它算成屏幕 x,所以只镜像绘制会把所有点击留在原地。"

