msgid "3  Text and chrome"
msgstr "3  文本与窗口外框"

#: tmainform.divtext.caption
msgid "Text - word order, shaping and the caret are bidirectional. The BLOCK does not mirror."
msgstr "文本 —— 词序、字形连写与光标都是双向的。**文本块本身不镜像**。"

#: tmainform.lblarabic.caption
