#: tmainform.divchrome.caption
msgid "What to press in this area"
msgstr "这一区该按什么"

#: tmainform.lbltextnote.caption
msgid "MIRRORS here: nothing in the four rows above. An edit and a memo keep their text block, margins and scroll bar on the left in either direction - only the reordering INSIDE a line is bidirectional, and that half is always on and needs no switch. What IS bidirectional: click a glyph and the caret lands on THAT glyph, including at the far side of an embedded run; Left/Right move one glyph the way the key points, crossing runs in screen order; Home/End stay logical, so on a right-to-left line Home puts the caret at the right of the ink. Drag across the Mixed memo line: a selection crossing a direction boundary paints one band PER RUN, so it can highlight glyphs the pointer never passed over - that is the range between the two endpoints, and it is what every other editor does. The Arabic rows are also the shaping test: the letters must JOIN into their contextual forms, not stand isolated. That was measured and pinned on Windows only; on GTK and Cocoa it is the platform text engine's answer and this window is the only way to see it."
msgstr "这里**没有任何东西镜像**:上面四行都不。编辑框与备注框在两个方向下都把文本块、边距和滚动条留在左边 —— 只有**行内的重排**是双向的,而那一半一直开着,不需要开关。**确实是双向的**:点某个字形,光标就落到**那个**字形上,包括嵌入段落远端的那一侧;Left/Right 按键朝哪边就走一个字形,跨段按屏幕顺序走;Home/End 保持**逻辑**含义,所以在一行从右往左的文字上,Home 把光标放在字迹的**右**端。在混排的备注框那一行上拖选:跨方向边界的选区会**按段分成多条高亮带**,因此可能高亮到指针没划过的字形 —— 那就是两个端点之间的范围,别的编辑器也都这么做。阿拉伯文那两行同时是**字形连写**的检验:字母必须按上下文**连**起来,不能各自孤立。这一条只在 Windows 上量过并钉成了测试;GTK 与 Cocoa 上答案归平台文字引擎,而这个窗口是唯一能看见的办法。"

